# ─── Runtime artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leading slash anchors these to the repo root — unanchored, `data/` would
# also match the real argus/data/ source package and silently swallow any
# new file added under it
/runs/
argus_halt_*.json
/data/
/state/
.env.*
!.env.example

